'''[[Baliscano]]''' is a [[Sabir]]-based {{W|creole language}}.

'''Baliscano''' commonly refers to:
* [[Balisca]], a country in [[Abyala]]
* [[Baliscans]], residents of Balisca
* [[Café baliscano]], a coffee drink
'''Baliscano''' may also refer to:

* [[Baliscan cuisine]]
** [[Baliscan lemonade]]
*[[Rugta Baliscano, Samara|Rugta Baliscano]], a Baliscan [[W:Ethnic enclave|ethnic enclave]] in [[Samara]], [[Burawa]]

